  "description": "⭐ <em>London, gear up for </em><strong><em>Race Across the World: The Experience </em></strong><em>in the City of London, the official live experience of the award-winning TV show! No maps. No public transport. Just teamwork, strategy, and the city beneath your feet. Think fast, act smart, and race to victory!</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n📺 Dive into the official live experience of the hit TV show<br>\n🏙️ Explore the City of London's iconic landmarks and hidden gems as you race across 3 legs<br>\n☕ At each checkpoint take an optional break, with race-exclusive discounts available at partner venues<br>\n🧩 Solve clues, overcome physical puzzles, and unlock surprises along the way<br>\n💰 Manage your in-game budget wisely to access shortcuts and new routes&nbsp;<br>\n🏆 Your race, your choices — become the daily, weekly, or all-time champion!&nbsp;<br>\n👨‍👨‍👧‍👧 The perfect after-work or weekend activity with friends, family, and colleagues<br>\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Race Across the World: The Experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/342067\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n🕒 Opening hours:&nbsp;<br>\n- Monday–Saturday: 9 a.m.&nbsp;– 7:30 p.m. (last entry at 7:30 p.m.)<br>\n- Sunday: 9:30 a.m. – 4:30 p.m. (last entry at 4:30 p.m.)<br>\n⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours&nbsp;<br>\n📍 Location: Liverpool St. Station<br>\n👤 Age requirement: All ages are welcome, however, you must be 18 or older to purchase tickets, and an adult ticket must be purchased along with a Child ticket. Children under 10 enter for free.<br>\n♿ Accessibility: the experience is wheelchair accessible<br>\n👥 2-8 players per team:<em> </em><strong>Make one booking for your teams,</strong> purchase your tickets together, to play together! Large groups can<strong> </strong>split into smaller teams (on the same or back to back time slots) and go head-to-head!<br>\n📧 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://citydays.com/raceacrosstheworld/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Set up your team here</strong></a><strong> before to access the experience</strong><br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/london/faqs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nYou’ve seen it on TV, now it’s your turn to race! The <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Race Across the World Experience</em></a> packs all the excitement of the hit TV show into a 2 to 3-hour private team adventure across London. The streets become your playground as you navigate the city, solve escape room-style puzzles, and manage your budget in this high-stakes foot race. Just like the show, every route you take, decision you make, and virtual penny you spend affects your journey. At the end, your team’s score, based on time and remaining funds, will determine your spot on the live leaderboard. Do you have what it takes to be crowned the daily or weekly champions? There’s only one way to find out… Get your tickets today!<br>\nWe also offer a new route in London’s West End — check it out <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/500032\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Group bookings over 50+ people with bespoke requirements? </strong>The experience is suitable for large groups of any size, you can book direct on this page (choose your number of teams, you can span multiple time slots), or fill in the enquiry form here - <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/london/groups/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/london/groups/</a>",
